# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON: Optional Firebase Admin Service Account JSON (falls back to GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON if same project).
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON=""
